  "item_short_desc": "<p>Experience the ultimate blend of comfort and functionality with Rothco's Anorak Parka. Crafted with a durable cotton-poly blend, this pullover jacket offers unbeatable comfort and long-lasting performance, making it ideal for both outdoor excursions and everyday wear.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "45",
  "description": "<p>Experience the ultimate blend of comfort and functionality with Rothco's Anorak Parka. Crafted with a durable cotton-poly blend, this pullover jacket offers unbeatable comfort and long-lasting performance, making it ideal for both outdoor excursions and everyday wear. Designed to withstand the elements, it features a lightweight polyester interior lining that provides added warmth without sacrificing breathability. The lined hood ensures protection from wind and rain, keeping you dry and comfortable in changing weather conditions. Equipped with a large centered zipper pocket, this anorak parka offers convenient storage for your everyday essentials, allowing you to keep your belongings close at hand wherever you go. Its quarter zip main closure facilitates easy layering, making it versatile enough to wear over your favorite shirts or under heavier jackets for extra warmth. For a personalized fit, the hook and loop adjustable cuffs ensure a snug sleeve fit, keeping out cold drafts and sealing in warmth. Whether you're exploring the great outdoors or navigating urban landscapes, Rothco's Anorak Parka provides the perfect combination of style, comfort, and functionality to keep you prepared for whatever adventures come your way.</p>",
